{"id":2275,"date":"2015-01-20T21:23:10","date_gmt":"2015-01-20T21:23:10","guid":{"rendered":"http:\/\/www.bentwoodcreek.org.php72-28.phx1-2.websitetestlink.com\/?page_id=2275"},"modified":"2021-08-03T00:53:57","modified_gmt":"2021-08-03T00:53:57","slug":"safety-security","status":"publish","type":"page","link":"http:\/\/www.bentwoodcreek.org\/safety-security\/","title":{"rendered":"Safety &#038; Security"},"content":{"rendered":"<div class=\"row \">\n<div class=\"span8 \"><p><a href=\"\/wp-content\/uploads\/2015\/10\/safety.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" class=\"alignleft size-full wp-image-2470\" src=\"\/wp-content\/uploads\/2015\/10\/safety.jpg\" alt=\"safety\" width=\"770\" height=\"300\" srcset=\"http:\/\/www.bentwoodcreek.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2015\/10\/safety.jpg 770w, http:\/\/www.bentwoodcreek.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2015\/10\/safety-300x117.jpg 300w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 770px) 100vw, 770px\" \/><\/a><\/p>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<h3>Drive Cautiously<\/h3>\n<p>The speed limit in our neighborhood is <strong>20 MPH<\/strong>. This is for the safety of us all as we have many walkers, runners, and children in our neighborhood.<\/p><\/div>\n<div class=\"span4 \"><h3><img loading=\"lazy\" class=\"alignleft size-full wp-image-2480\" src=\"\/wp-content\/uploads\/2015\/01\/safety.png\" alt=\"safety\" width=\"75\" height=\"72\">&nbsp;&nbsp;Safety &amp; Security<\/h3>\n<p>Please be very cautious about leaving your garage doors up even when you are home. This is a common target for thieves to make a quick hit on lawn equipment or other valuable property. In addition, please do not leave personal property in your vehicles as this creates an easy opportunity for theft.<\/p>\n<p>There have been recent driveway robberies in our general area. Please be very diligent when you come and go and always keep a watchful eye out for any suspicious activity <a style=\"color: #404040; text-decoration: none;\" href=\"https:\/\/maideasyaz.com\/scottsdale-az\/house-cleaning-services\/\">bi-weekly or monthly<\/a>. Be proactive in reporting such activity to the police as well as the association. If reported, we will alert all homeowners of any situation out of the ordinary.<\/p><\/div>\n<\/div><!-- .row (end) -->\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":0,"parent":0,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"open","template":"","meta":{"spay_email":""},"jetpack_sharing_enabled":true,"jetpack_shortlink":"https:\/\/wp.me\/P5DVUB-AH","_links":{"self":[{"href":"http:\/\/www.bentwoodcreek.org\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/pages\/2275"}],"collection":[{"href":"http:\/\/www.bentwoodcreek.org\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/pages"}],"about":[{"href":"http:\/\/www.bentwoodcreek.org\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/page"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"http:\/\/www.bentwoodcreek.org\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/1"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"http:\/\/www.bentwoodcreek.org\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=2275"}],"version-history":[{"count":3,"href":"http:\/\/www.bentwoodcreek.org\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/pages\/2275\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":76830,"href":"http:\/\/www.bentwoodcreek.org\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/pages\/2275\/revisions\/76830"}],"wp:attachment":[{"href":"http:\/\/www.bentwoodcreek.org\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media?parent=2275"}],"curies":[{"name":"wp","href":"https:\/\/api.w.org\/{rel}","templated":true}]}}